  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Place the frozen seafood mix in the oven in a single layer on a baking sheet.",
    "Bake for 8 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, heat the coconut oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté for 3-4 minutes or until softened.",
    "Add the yellow curry paste and sauté for 1-2 minutes or until fragrant.",
    "Add the garlic, frozen corn, and bamboo shoots. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked seafood mix to the saucepan and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Serve hot in a bamboo tray."
